   300	  area. In stmap6 exact-area recovery, a wide high-fanout cut is rejected only
   301	  when the existing match has slack and the candidate does not save at least
   302	  half an inverter area. In stmap7, the area-saving override additionally
   303	  requires more than two inverter delays of slack and excludes the highest
   304	  fanout-risk bucket. In stmap8, the override is further rejected when the
   305	  candidate match worsens mapper arrival by more than one quarter of an
   306	  inverter delay. In stmap9, middle-slack candidates can recover area only
   307	  when they are outside the highest fanout bucket, do not worsen mapper
